## 6. Data Layer — Schema & Repo

### Hybrid Schema Design (Hard Columns + jsonb)

For performance-critical tables, use **hard columns** for frequently filtered
fields and **jsonb** for flexible/polymorphic data:

```typescript
// modules/evaluation/evaluation.schema.ts
export const evaluationTable = pgTable("evaluations", {
  id: serial("id").primaryKey(),
  userId: integer("user_id").notNull(),
  url: text("url").notNull(),
  query: text("query").notNull(),
  status: text("status").notNull().default("pending"),

  // Hard columns for scores (indexable, frequently queried)
  semanticScore: numeric("semantic_score", { precision: 5, scale: 4 })
    .nullable(),
  articleScore: numeric("article_score", { precision: 5, scale: 4 }).nullable(),
  overallScore: numeric("overall_score", { precision: 5, scale: 4 }).nullable(),

  // jsonb for structured but non-indexed data
  semanticAllChunks: jsonb("semantic_all_chunks").$type<ChunkScore[]>(),
  semanticQueryMatrix: jsonb("semantic_query_matrix").$type<MatrixData>(),
  articleBreakdown: jsonb("article_breakdown").$type<ArticleBreakdown>(),

  // Metadata
  contentHash: text("content_hash").nullable(),
  contentWordCount: integer("content_word_count").nullable(),
  hyposEmbeddings: vector("hypos_embeddings", { dimensions: 4096 }).nullable(),

  createdAt: timestamp("created_at").notNull().defaultNow(),
  updatedAt: timestamp("updated_at").notNull().defaultNow(),
}, (table) => ({
  statusIdx: index("status_idx").on(table.status),
  scoreIdx: index("score_idx").on(table.overallScore),
  userStatusIdx: index("user_status_idx").on(table.userId, table.status),
}));
```

**Rule**: Add an **index** on every column you filter by. Composite indexes for
common query patterns.

### jsonb Override in DTO (CRITICAL)

When generating Zod schemas from Drizzle tables with jsonb columns:

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
const BaseInsertSchema = createInsertSchema(evaluationTable, {
  semanticAllChunks: z.record(z.string(), z.any()),
  semanticQueryMatrix: z.record(z.string(), z.any()),
});
export const CreateEvaluationBodySchema = BaseInsertSchema.omit({ id: true, ... });

// ❌ WRONG — auto-inference fails for jsonb
export const CreateEvaluationBodySchema = createInsertSchema(evaluationTable).omit({ id: true });
```

### Repo Pattern

```typescript
export const evaluationRepo = {
  db: getDbPool(),

  async create(data: CreateEvaluationBody): Promise<EvaluationDTO> {
    const [result] = await this.db.insert(evaluationTable)
      .values(data)
      .returning();
    return result;
  },

  async updateStatus(id: number, status: EvaluationStatus): Promise<void> {
    await this.db.update(evaluationTable)
      .set({ status, updatedAt: new Date() })
      .where(eq(evaluationTable.id, id));
  },

  async updateScores(id: number, scores: ScoreFields): Promise<void> {
    await this.db.update(evaluationTable)
      .set({ ...scores, updatedAt: new Date() })
      .where(eq(evaluationTable.id, id))
      .returning();
  },
};
```

**Rules**:

- Always `.returning()` on mutations
- Always set `updatedAt: new Date()` on updates
- Named export only (`export const`), no default export

