## 11. Naming, DTO, and Conventions

### File Naming

| Kind             | Convention              | Example                                  |
| ---------------- | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| Module files     | kebab-case              | `evaluation.dto.ts`, `health.schema.ts`  |
| Internal service | kebab-case              | `web.service.ts`, `embedding.service.ts` |
| Processor files  | kebab-case              | `query.processor.ts`, `url.processor.ts` |
| Test files       | `<name>.<type>.test.ts` | `evaluation.api.test.ts`                 |
| Engine files     | kebab-case              | `jina.engine.ts`                         |
| Utils            | kebab-case              | `error-factory.ts`, `test-setup.ts`      |

### DTO Pattern

```typescript
// 1. Base schema from Drizzle, override jsonb columns
const BaseInsertSchema = createInsertSchema(table, {
  [jsonColumn]: z.record(z.string(), z.any()),
});

// 2. Create: omit id + timestamps
export const CreateXxxBodySchema = BaseInsertSchema.omit({
  id: true,
  createdAt: true,
  updatedAt: true,
});

// 3. Update: partial of create
export const UpdateXxxBodySchema = CreateXxxBodySchema.partial();

// 4. Query: z.coerce for URL params
export const FindXxxQuerySchema = z.object({
  id: z.coerce.number().int().positive().optional(),
  limit: z.coerce.number().int().min(1).max(100).default(20),
  latestAt: z.coerce.date().optional(),
});

// 5. Params: z.coerce
export const XxxIdParamSchema = z.object({
  id: z.coerce.number().int().positive(),
});

// 6. Always export types via z.infer
export type CreateXxxBody = z.infer<typeof CreateXxxBodySchema>;
```

### Service Naming

| Pattern                   | Convention             | Example                                           |
| ------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Module service            | camelCase named export | `export const evaluationService = {...}`          |
| Internal service factory  | `createXxxService`     | `export const createWebService = (...) => {...}`  |
| Internal service instance | camelCase              | `webService`, `embeddingService`                  |
| Processor factory         | `createXxxProcessor`   | `export const createQueryProcessor = () => {...}` |
| Processor instance        | camelCase              | `queryProcessor`, `urlProcessor`                  |

### Response Formatting

```typescript
// Single record
ctx.response.body = { ok: true, data };

// Paginated list
ctx.response.body = { ok: true, data: items, hasMore, nextCursor };

// Do NOT set body on 204
ctx.response.status = 204;
```

### Error Handling

```typescript
import { ERROR_CODE, throwError } from "@src/shared/errors/error-factory.ts";

// In service: throw NOT_FOUND for missing records
const record = await repo.findOne(id);
if (!record) {
  throwError(ERROR_CODE.NOT_FOUND, { message: `Evaluation ${id} not found` });
}

// In worker: catch, update status, re-throw
} catch (err) {
  await repo.updateStatus(id, EvaluationStatus.FAILED);
  throw err;
}
```

