## 12. Pre-Commit Verification

All tests for the commit feature must passed

```bash
deno test --allow-all --env=.env.local .\src\<path>\<to>\<testfile>
```

Run all three in the `backend/` directory before committing:

```bash
deno check src/
deno lint src/
deno fmt src/
```

All three must pass with zero errors. No `@ts-ignore` or `@ts-expect-error`
suppressions. Use `// deno-lint-ignore` only with a specific comment explaining
why.

