## Quick Reference: When to Use What

| Scenario                        | Solution                                                       |
| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| New feature with HTTP endpoints | Create a `modules/<name>/` with all fié                        |
| New business logic, no HTTP     | Create `intenals/<name>/<name>.service.ts`                     |
| Complex multi-stage pipeline    | Create `intenals/core/processor/` with processor factories     |
| Long-running computation        | Queue job via BullMQ, worker calls internal services           |
| Complex DB queries              | Add hard columns + indexes to schema, avoid deep jsonb nesting |
| Calling external AI/APIs        | Create `engine.ts` in `libs/` or `intenals/<name>/`            |
| Module needs AI/embedding logic | Module service calls internal service                          |
| Worker needs to update DB       | Call repo directly, no service layer needed                    |
